language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Decide how many small and large boxwood chess sets to make each week to maximise profit.
find small_set : int(0..200)
find large_set : int(0..200)
find max_profit : int(0..100000)

maximising max_profit

such that
$ the lathe hours used (3 per small set, 2 per large set) must not exceed the 160 lathe-hours per week
3 * small_set + 2 * large_set <= 160,
$ the boxwood used (1 kg per small set, 3 kg per large set) must not exceed the 200 kg per week
small_set + 3 * large_set <= 200,
$ the profit is $5 per small set and $20 per large set
max_profit = 5 * small_set + 20 * large_set
